        "grading": "Letter Grade",
        "impacted": "No",
        "level": "Upper Division",
        "course_description": "Lecture, three hours; discussion, one hour. Requisite: Life Sciences 7B. Strongly recommended for prospective Marine Biology Quarter students. Introduction to physical and biological world of 70 percent of planet: oceans. Designed to be integrative, with focus on geological evolution of seas, physical and chemical properties of water, and how these abiotic processes shape ecology and evolution of marine organisms and environments. Letter grading.",
